- ✅ Complex business logic (explain WHY, not WHAT)
- ✅ Non-obvious algorithms
- ✅ Workarounds/hacks (explain why and link to issue)
- ✅ Public APIs (JSDoc for exported functions)

### 2. When NOT to Comment
- ❌ Obvious code (code should be self-documenting)
- ❌ TODOs without context (use issue tracking)
- ❌ Outdated comments (delete or update)

